# Personal/family photos — used locally as playable characters, intentionally kept out of
# this public repo. The app still imports these paths (src/shared/profile/characters.ts),
# so a fresh clone needs its own copies of these 3 files locally for `npm run build` to
# fully succeed; everything else (including the "upload your own photo" feature) works
# without them.
public/1.jpg
public/2.jpg
public/3.jpg
src/shared/assets/1.jpg
src/shared/assets/2.jpg
src/shared/assets/3.jpg
